:: Main Menu Gallery [system] {"position":"0,650"}
/*
	Content of the "Gallery" panel on the main menu. Plain HTML / SugarCube markup.
	Wrap all tiles in <div class="mm-gallery">. Unlocked tile:
	<figure class="mm-tile" style="margin:0"><img src="images/path/to/thumbnail.jpg" alt="Scene name" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Scene name</figcaption></figure>
	Locked placeholder tile (use <<if>> to show the unlocked version once a variable is set):
	<div class="mm-tile locked"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg></div>
	An optional hint below the grid: <p class="mm-empty">Text</p>
*/
